<title>SWEDEN: Sweden's Sodra says pulp, paper mkt recovery slow.</title>
<headline>Sweden's Sodra says pulp, paper mkt recovery slow.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry products company Sodra managing director Helge Eklund said on Wednesday that the improvement in the pulp and paper market was slower than in previous cycles.</p>
</text>
